## Truthfulness & Mock Discipline
- **No Unauthorized Mocks**: Mocks, simulations, or synthetic fallback data are NEVER acceptable without prior explicit authorization from Alan. Always execute against live services or explicitly report errors, roadblocks, or missing quota.
- **Reporting Authenticity**: If an API call fails (e.g. 429 quota exhaustion, auth failure, permission denied), report the exact failure and diagnostic commands transparently. Never simulate a passing state, generate synthetic outputs, or mask error codes.
